WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Comments and mentions. Discuss a task in its drawer and @mention teammates to notify them.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Use it for: ask for input; record a decision.

3
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:11.740
(Note: Milo joined the workspace before the recording.) Type @ to mention a teammate…

4
00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:13.990
…pick them from the suggestions…

5
00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:16.070
…and post. Milo gets a notification and an email.

6
00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:22.490
Authors can edit their comments…

7
00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:26.530
…and edits are marked.

8
00:00:26.530 --> 00:00:32.530
No Edit comment button: You can only edit your own comments.

9
00:00:32.530 --> 00:00:37.030
@mentions with suggestions
